# Build outputs never belong in the image: the container restores and builds from source.
# Without this, a host `obj/project.assets.json` (absolute paths from the developer's machine)
# is copied over the restore the image performs, and the publish fails on packages that the
# image never downloaded.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/TestResults/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
.git/
.gitignore
